<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation dips to 6.35 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation dips to 6.35 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.35 percent in the week ended April 26 from 6.54 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	April 26   April 19    April 27, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.35	 +6.54	  +4.97</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   323.4	 322.5	  304.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for the week ended April 27, 1996.</p>
</text>
